2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Misc

2024-01-02 * "Thousands separators"
  Expenses:Misc   1,234.56 GBP
  Assets:Cash    -1,234.56 GBP

2024-01-03 * "Plus sign and no leading digit"
  Expenses:Misc   +7 GBP
  Assets:Cash    -7 GBP

2024-01-04 * "Many decimal places"
  Expenses:Misc   0.123456789012 GBP
  Assets:Cash    -0.123456789012 GBP

2024-01-05 * "Trailing zeros kept"
  Expenses:Misc   10.5000 GBP
  Assets:Cash    -10.5000 GBP

2024-01-06 * "Leading dot"
  Expenses:Misc   .50 GBP
  Assets:Cash    -.50 GBP
